    "interim_director_review": "Agree",
    "project_results": "In Q2YR5, I-Youth trained 4,286 youths (39% of the 10,940 target) for employment and entrepreneurship, with 81% and 49% female participation, respectively. 7,293 jobs were created, mainly in Kaduna and Adamawa. Business registration support was provided to 3,141 businesses, and ₦10.3M in loans was accessed. Agribusiness parks expanded in Kano, Lagos, and Kaduna, enhancing digital and e-commerce training.",
