    "interim_director_review": "Agree",
    "project_results": "The CH integrated 45 TAAT-vetted technologies into national and regional agricultural projects, exceeding the 25-case target. It participated in 12 AfDB missions, supporting new project designs. A remodeled Country Engagement Strategy enhanced technology brokerage, while new engagement officers expanded outreach. Gender and private sector strategies were developed, alongside monitoring tools and capacity-building initiatives.",
